(7032024, 1067810, 37252, '<td valign="top">I really like this fountain and the choice of BW. I only wish you had cropped the image more as when I scroll down and get rid of the feet of the person walking down the steps the image greatly improves.</td>', 'I really like this fountain and the choice of BW. I only wish you had cropped the image more as when I scroll down and get rid of the feet of the person walking down the steps the image greatly improves.', '2013-05-04 17:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
