(7034484, 1067900, 61396, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dr.Confuser:</b></div><hr/><i>It was a twenty-minute drive to Seattle Center, a twenty-minute shoot; a twenty-minute drive home, and twenty minutes in editing. Feels too easy. Maybe Im missing something. Good camera; good software; on-challenge subject; innovative take on the challenge; good thumbnail invites opening  Im not sure what Im missing. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>you didn''t miss much after all, Doc.</td>', 'Originally posted by Dr.Confuser:It was a twenty-minute drive to Seattle Center, a twenty-minute shoot; a twenty-minute drive home, and twenty minutes in editing. Feels too easy. Maybe Im missing something. Good camera; good software; on-challenge subject; innovative take on the challenge; good thumbnail invites opening  Im not sure what Im missing.  you didn''t miss much after all, Doc.', '2013-05-08 14:21:47.000000', NULL, 0),
